      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1745818308005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sorting\n--------\nStable and Inplace sorting\n\nStable: Relative order of equal elements is maintained as it\nis.\nMerge sort\nbubble sort\ninsertion sort\ncount sort\nradix sort\n\n1 2 3 3 6 5 4\n\n10 20 30 40 50\n\n20 10 30 40 50\n\n20 10 40 30 50\n\n10 20 30 40 50\n\n\nInplace: uses minimal extra memory apart from what is\nallocated.\n\nbubble sort\nselection sort\nheap sort\ninsertion sort\nquick sort\n\n\nbubble sort basic\n------------------\n\noriginal array: 10 40 30 50 20\n\n1st iteration: 10 30 40 20 50\n2nd iteration: 10 30 20 40\n3rd iteration: 10 20 30\n4th iteration: 10 20\n\nfinal sorted array is: 10 20 30 40 50",
      "fontSize": 43,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sorting\n--------\nStable and Inplace sorting\n\nStable: Relative order of equal elements is maintained as it is.\nMerge sort\nbubble sort\ninsertion sort\ncount sort\nradix sort\n\n1 2 3 3 6 5 4\n\n10 20 30 40 50\n\n20 10 30 40 50\n\n20 10 40 30 50\n\n10 20 30 40 50\n\n\nInplace: uses minimal extra memory apart from what is allocated.\n\nbubble sort\nselection sort\nheap sort\ninsertion sort\nquick sort\n\n\nbubble sort basic\n------------------\n\noriginal array: 10 40 30 50 20\n\n1st iteration: 10 30 40 20 50\n2nd iteration: 10 30 20 40\n3rd iteration: 10 20 30\n4th iteration: 10 20\n\nfinal sorted array is: 10 20 30 40 50",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
