      "text": "QUICK SORT\n------------\n\ninput array: \n\n7 6 10 5 9 2 1 15 7\ni                 j \n\n7 6 10 5 9 2 1 15 7\n     i            j\n\n7 6 7 5 9 2 1 15 10\n    i             j\n\n7 6 7 5 9 2 1 15 10\n        i   j\n\n7 6 7 5 1 2 9 15 10\n          j  i          \n\n\n2 6 7 5 1 7 9 15 10\n          j\n\nqs(a,low,j-1)\nqs(a,j+1,high)\n\n\n2 6 7 5 1\ni       j\n\n2 6 7 5 1\n  i     j\n\n2 1 7 5 6\n  i     j\n\n2 1 7 5 6\n  i   j\n2 1 7 5 6\n  i j\n\n2 1 7 5 6\n i,j\n\nswap 1 with pivot 2\n\n1 2 7 5 6\n  j\n\nqs(a,2,4)\nqs(a,0,0)\n\n7 5 6\ni    j\n\n7 5 6\n  i j\n7 5 6\n    i,j\n7 5 6\n    j i\n\n7 5 6\n   \n6 5 7\n    j\n\n6 5\n\n5 6\n\n\npivot=2\nlow=0\nhigh=4\n\n\nwhile(a[i]<=pivot and i<j\n  do i++\nwhile(a[j]>pivot and i<j\n    do j--\n\nif(i<j)\n   swap a[i] and a[j]\n\nswap a[j] with pivot (a[low])\n\n\n\n\n\nconsider 7 as the pivot element: (first element)\n\nlow=0\nhigh-n-1\n\nquicksort(a,low,high)\n{\n  i=low\n  j=high\n\n    if(i<j)\n    {\n       \n",
      "fontSize": 43,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "QUICK SORT\n------------\n\ninput array: \n\n7 6 10 5 9 2 1 15 7\ni                 j \n\n7 6 10 5 9 2 1 15 7\n     i            j\n\n7 6 7 5 9 2 1 15 10\n    i             j\n\n7 6 7 5 9 2 1 15 10\n        i   j\n\n7 6 7 5 1 2 9 15 10\n          j  i          \n\n\n2 6 7 5 1 7 9 15 10\n          j\n\nqs(a,low,j-1)\nqs(a,j+1,high)\n\n\n2 6 7 5 1\ni       j\n\n2 6 7 5 1\n  i     j\n\n2 1 7 5 6\n  i     j\n\n2 1 7 5 6\n  i   j\n2 1 7 5 6\n  i j\n\n2 1 7 5 6\n i,j\n\nswap 1 with pivot 2\n\n1 2 7 5 6\n  j\n\nqs(a,2,4)\nqs(a,0,0)\n\n7 5 6\ni    j\n\n7 5 6\n  i j\n7 5 6\n    i,j\n7 5 6\n    j i\n\n7 5 6\n   \n6 5 7\n    j\n\n6 5\n\n5 6\n\n\npivot=2\nlow=0\nhigh=4\n\n\nwhile(a[i]<=pivot and i<j\n  do i++\nwhile(a[j]>pivot and i<j\n    do j--\n\nif(i<j)\n   swap a[i] and a[j]\n\nswap a[j] with pivot (a[low])\n\n\n\n\n\nconsider 7 as the pivot element: (first element)\n\nlow=0\nhigh-n-1\n\nquicksort(a,low,high)\n{\n  i=low\n  j=high\n\n    if(i<j)\n    {\n       \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
